---
title: "Modlock play session"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Starting: mods mounted, host starting
  s1: Host gone: Wait cleans up
  s2: Stopping: unmounting the mods
  s3: Host up: waiting for Ready
  s4: Stopping: ending the host
  s5: Playing: the game runs
  s6: Ended: mods unmounted
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the host exits or crashes
  s0 --> s2: the player ends the session or Start's context ends
  s0 --> s3: the host dials the control link
  s1 --> s2: the player ends the session or Start's context ends
  s2 --> s4: Stop unmounts the mods
  s3 --> s1: the host exits or crashes
  s3 --> s2: the player ends the session or Start's context ends
  s4 --> s1: Stop ends the host
  s3 --> s5: Ready arrives and the game launches
  s1 --> s6: the link's last events arrive
  s5 --> s1: the host exits or crashes
  s5 --> s2: the player ends the session or Start's context ends
  s2 --> s6: the link's last events arrive
  s4 --> s6: the link's last events arrive
